
# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheRavenousJelly/scr.rpy:20
translate es qst_ravenJelly_inspectSlime_07db75da:

    # "The small slime creature inside slithered around in its container."
    "La pequeña criatura viscosa que había dentro se deslizaba por el recipiente."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheRavenousJelly/scr.rpy:21
translate es qst_ravenJelly_inspectSlime_2f672038:

